Options -Indexes
ServerSignature Off

Header always set X-Frame-Options "DENY"
Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
Header always set Referrer-Policy "no-referrer"
Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self';"

Header unset X-Powered-By
Header always unset X-Powered-By